1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,773
According to the Ministry of Health,

2
00:00:03,813 --> 00:00:07,443
stroke causes 18.5 percent
of deaths in Indonesia.

3
00:00:09,143 --> 00:00:14,524
Yet only 49.2 percent of people
with stroke have regular check-ups.

4
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:20,196
Therapists are scarce too:
only 926 physical therapy

5
00:00:20,236 --> 00:00:24,479
staff across more than 10,000
community health centres.

6
00:00:26,179 --> 00:00:31,534
After leaving hospital, the exercise
programme is often just a sheet of paper.

7
00:00:33,234 --> 00:00:38,547
At home, the question is simple
but heavy: am I doing this right?

8
00:00:38,587 --> 00:00:41,881
That is where guidance often breaks off.

9
00:00:43,581 --> 00:00:48,229
With PULIHIN, an ordinary phone
becomes a home exercise companion.

10
00:00:48,269 --> 00:00:52,672
Open it, and Today's Exercises
are right there, in large type.

11
00:00:54,372 --> 00:00:58,214
We start with one small
movement: Elbow Flexion.

12
00:00:58,254 --> 00:01:03,672
A 3D demonstration shows its rhythm,
together with a safety notice.

13
00:01:05,372 --> 00:01:07,775
The app shows where the phone goes:

14
00:01:07,815 --> 00:01:11,334
upright on a table,
about one metre from the chair.

15
00:01:11,374 --> 00:01:14,724
Pak Budi in this video
is an AI-generated scene.

16
00:01:16,424 --> 00:01:20,839
This camera video is AI-generated too,
played into the real app.

17
00:01:21,924 --> 00:01:22,934
[App] Position your body inside the frame.

18
00:01:22,974 --> 00:01:24,702
[App] Body detected.

19
00:01:24,742 --> 00:01:28,681
Remember, stop if you
feel pain or dizziness.

20
00:01:28,721 --> 00:01:29,871
Start slowly.

21
00:01:30,221 --> 00:01:34,583
Body landmarks are read right on
the device, without uploading video.

22
00:01:36,396 --> 00:01:38,852
Listen: the app is counting.

23
00:01:42,450 --> 00:01:44,749
Now the shoulder hikes up.

24
00:01:45,149 --> 00:01:48,131
[App] Relax your shoulder,
lower your shoulder.

25
00:01:49,249 --> 00:01:53,664
The app reminds him right away,
by voice and in large text.

26
00:01:59,326 --> 00:02:00,336
[App] Great!

27
00:02:00,376 --> 00:02:01,511
Target reached.

28
00:02:03,277 --> 00:02:07,056
At the end of the session there
is a score and a simple summary:

29
00:02:07,096 --> 00:02:11,035
repetitions and duration, with labels
that are easy to understand.

30
00:02:14,277 --> 00:02:17,895
There is one tip for the next
session, and a disclaimer

31
00:02:17,935 --> 00:02:22,192
that always appears: this is an
exercise score, not a diagnosis.

32
00:02:23,892 --> 00:02:27,455
Back on the home screen,
Elbow Flexion is marked done.

33
00:02:27,495 --> 00:02:31,232
The exercise is recorded,
and the family can see it too.

34
00:02:32,932 --> 00:02:36,059
Elsewhere, Rina,
his daughter, no longer has

35
00:02:36,099 --> 00:02:39,123
to guess whether her father has exercised.

36
00:02:40,823 --> 00:02:44,112
The For Family page shows
today's status, a flag

37
00:02:44,152 --> 00:02:48,451
when exercise has stopped,
and a chart of the last seven days.

38
00:02:52,823 --> 00:02:56,165
The 14-day score trend is
there too, and the weekly

39
00:02:56,205 --> 00:02:59,719
summary can be copied with
one tap for the therapist.

40
00:03:03,823 --> 00:03:06,281
For speech difficulties, or aphasia,

41
00:03:06,321 --> 00:03:10,484
there is Speech Practice in
Indonesian, with everyday words.

42
00:03:11,034 --> 00:03:13,385
The Listen button plays an example.

43
00:03:13,964 --> 00:03:15,620
[App] sabun (soap)

44
00:03:15,660 --> 00:03:17,392
[App] Wash your hands with soap.

45
00:03:21,723 --> 00:03:23,123
[Pak Budi, AI] Sabun (soap).

46
00:03:23,462 --> 00:03:24,862
[App] Correct!

47
00:03:24,902 --> 00:03:25,952
Very good.

48
00:03:26,302 --> 00:03:30,075
In Self-Practice Mode,
the companion scores

49
00:03:30,115 --> 00:03:33,042
with one tap: Correct, or Repeat.

50
00:03:34,742 --> 00:03:38,386
On the Therapist Dashboard,
the therapist sets the programme

51
00:03:38,426 --> 00:03:41,926
and follows progress,
without waiting for the next visit.

52
00:03:44,742 --> 00:03:47,850
In this prototype, the programme
the therapist saves becomes

53
00:03:47,890 --> 00:03:50,724
Today's Exercises on the
patient's profile right away.

54
00:03:55,742 --> 00:03:58,391
PULIHIN does not replace the therapist.

55
00:03:58,431 --> 00:04:01,838
It helps make sure that
what the therapist teaches

56
00:04:01,878 --> 00:04:04,911
is truly practised at home,
with the family.

57
00:04:05,461 --> 00:04:10,367
This is a competition prototype,
not a regulated medical device.

58
00:04:10,407 --> 00:04:12,958
Try it now at pulihin.vercel.app.
